- One verdict per record of the manifest, and only for those records; `action` is `confirm`, `downgrade`, `refute`, `overturn` or `uphold` (a coverage claim takes `confirm` or `refute` only); every verdict carries a non-empty `witness`.
- `claims` holds your claim list of every passage you judge a location, a coverage claim, an absence or an unresolved outcome of — whatever the verdict; each verdict that leaves a relation that counts, and each overturn location, names its `clauses` from it, and a coverage confirm its `part_clauses`.
- A downgrade to `closeMatch` also gives `convention` — one of `notation`, `encoding`, `normalisation`, `renaming`, `unfolding`, `bundling`; a junk value is none (PD7) — and `note`: what the declaration does by it ("Lean indexes the sequence from 0 where the passage starts at 1", "the map is bundled with its inverse"), not what the passage leaves out. Without a `note`, the first sentence of your `witness` that copies no more than twelve consecutive words of the article becomes the record's note, so make that sentence name the difference. A confirm of a `closeMatch` whose record names no `convention` gives one. A `convention` belongs to a verdict that leaves a `closeMatch`, and a `step` to one that leaves a `hasPart` or `narrowMatch`, and to no other.
- Your own `note` (and the witness sentence that stands in for it) on a verdict that leaves an `exactMatch` or `closeMatch` says none of {{generality_phrases}} (… is any ending): each names a generalisation, a strengthening, a weakening or a special case, which is no convention. A record's own note — the worker's — that uses one of them is a claim to check, not a verdict: judge the declaration by R1–R7 (a strictly increasing list is no strengthening).
- The note and the witness are held to the cap an overturn location's note is: a `note` that copies more than twelve consecutive words of the article is refused, and so is a `witness` without a `note` whose every sentence does.
- Copy `item`, `location_key`, the source's shas and `renderer` from the manifest exactly; write no commit and no `proof_status`.
- Write an overturn location's `note` in your own words: one that copies more than twelve consecutive words of the article is refused, since the published records quote no more than that.

